t memory.\n\nPredeclared correction:\n\n- Preserve both 1,200,000,000-byte allocations and both live array-length checks.\n- Preserve the explicit signed i64 counter, the above-2-GiB check, and the minimum logical-request check.\n- Replace the stale 2.5-billion upper estimate with exact equality to 2,684,354,560 reservation bytes.\n- Preserve successful exit code two and all failure handling.\n- Require controlled signed-i32 truncation, a zero counter, and a one-byte incorrect counter to fail for their exact reasons.\n- Change no production compiler, allocator, size class, workload, baseline, tolerance, or global validation gate.\n\nAcceptance:\n\n- [x] Preserve fresh-main failure, exact reservation observations, and source/tool identities.\n- [x] Correct the stale fixture estimate with an exact reservation assertion and unchanged allocation workload.\n- [x] Pass the original i64 controls and meaningful counter-mutation controls without skips.\n- [x] Pass adjacent heap-counter and large-class integrity checks, format, build, vet, and selected source checks.\n- [x] Merge one READY PR normally at the exact full head and publish bounded evidence.\n\nThe two performance jobs in the same main run fail a separate strict size-report gate.\nTheir reports require separate cause analysis and do not authorize a baseline or threshold change here.\nActual CI recovery, M5, and epic acceptance remain open until their own gates pass.\n\n## Qualified completion\n\nPR #13711 merged normally at `25dc7ab983b955821432e3d2d67501df3a9a2ba5` with exact head `3354f2858f8f04e61b0b609a9b4d18579fa666f6`.\nThe verified parents are main 23c5 and that exact head.\nCI run 40587393667 showed `pending` status with zero jobs at the pre-merge read, not a pass.\n\nFresh main reproduced the original large-allocation fixture failure with two passing i64 controls and zero skips.\nThe corrected fixture pins the exact existing reservation total of 2,684,354,560 arena bytes.\nBoth allocation sizes, both live array-length checks, the signed i64 counter, and both lower-bound checks remain unchanged.\nThe seven selected heap-counter and large-class tests pass with zero skips.\nThree wrong-counter overlays fail for their exact reasons.\n\nGo build and vet pass for all packages, and the complete source audit records 219 passes with zero skips.\nGofmt and diff checks pass.\nThe committed test bytes exactly match the qualified candidate and all recorded source hashes.\nThe proof preserves the original failure, exact observations, API error, and matcher correction without a duplicate completed control run.\n\nEvidence: `docs/benchmarks/heap-bump-i64-2026-10-27/` at the exact PR head.\nThere is no production compiler, allocator, baseline, tolerance, workload, or global gate change.\nThese reservation counters do not establish resident memory or physical/process bounds.\nThe separate strict performance-report failures and actual parent CI recovery remain open.\nAll actual M5 and epic acceptance gates remain open.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JakeChampion/lang/issues/13710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JakeChampion/lang/issues/13710/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g